{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12mini_level_act12mini_st06",
  "groupId": "act12mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "空盔甲",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12mini/level_act12mini_st06.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1d8e217feaa62155e5b83872c8df1c15fb08585589e39a4fa2f90f0fb5ff4d98",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪恩納，我不相信他們會就這樣杳無音訊。你們臨光家的人，不應該毫無作為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但你的兄長，斯尼茨他可是這一代最傑出的軍事將領，我們都親眼見過......\n就算嫉妒，又有誰能否認他的能力？難道他們不想打勝仗了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——但你決不能回去！\n我說了，你們臨光家的人，不應該毫無作為......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不，我只是......\n......只是為了籌備一場刺殺，有些思慮過度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......刺殺？\n原來我是在夢中啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動手吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "12月1日 2:15 A.M.\n茨沃涅克城外"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征戰騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳令給潛伏在城中的哨兵，動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全員做好行軍準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征戰騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是大騎士長軍令在前，我們不能再擅自行動......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征戰騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......卡瓦萊利亞基顯然已經掌握了一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這幾句話能折斷騎士的槍嗎？還是將你們搭在弦上的弩箭都化作了齏粉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "民眾在恐慌中看到的保護者是征戰騎士，這一事實能被改寫嗎？還是說萊塔尼亞當真露出獠牙時，監正會敢不集結軍力支援？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們該做的事，不會因為監正會的否認而改變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "立即行動——這是命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征戰騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，您已經......無權下令了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征戰騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士團的指揮權已經收回至監正會，此事已經同時傳達各分隊隊長、工匠團等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征戰騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們終究是為了騎士團的地位，為了征戰騎士重獲其應有的重視而起事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征戰騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大騎士長的確有權否認這一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你不願意聽從嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，我親自來傳令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "征戰騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_624_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......給茨沃涅克城內的指令已發出，一切照原定計畫行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有異議的人，就跟我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "騎士團長將染上殷紅的佩劍收入鞘中，大步流星地走過駐軍的營帳。\n通宵待命的數十名高階征戰騎士業已列隊，卻只是沉默地站在他走過的路旁。\n沒有人出列，沒有人阻攔，也沒有人對他行禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "職員模樣的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，二位，由於最近事故多發，零點至早晨六點期間通過升降平臺出城的載具需要接受檢查，請出示識別碼和相關文書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貴族侍衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "職員模樣的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，請稍等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "職員模樣的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外，茨沃涅克特產香草牧獸肉乾現在有售，是您旅行紀念品的不二之選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必了，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他焦急地等待著，但檢查人員卻遲遲沒有示意放行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您看到萊塔尼亞的紋章，還需要檢查得這麼仔細嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——嗯？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個時間，已經不必考慮目擊者，更不用說輿論如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果箭矢被那名高塔術師化解，你們......允許使用投槍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不必那麼擔心後果，沒有哪座城市還記得征戰騎士出手的模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，老朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你果然還是要攔在我的路上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我該感到欣慰嗎？那麼多年過去，你總算還願意出面做點什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你在這裡，那麼今晚的茨沃涅克附近恐怕有一場雙方身份不明的暴力衝突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "賞金獵人和征戰騎士，哪一個都不該靠近轟鳴前行的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我只是按約定來取劍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是兩手空空地來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你呢？......你的追隨者呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道不是你自己最清楚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如你所願，大騎士領方面出手干涉了，那些忠誠的騎士服從了緊急命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了保有騎士的秩序與光榮，為了更長遠的利益......為了他們的征戰能被授予虛榮的功勳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大騎士領已經......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——啊，看你的表情......你不知道這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......監正會的視野循著血脈延伸，他們掌握卡西米爾每個角落的動向，與我無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，抱歉......不該是你。你絕不會向監正會、向大騎士長求援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟，你來勸我回頭了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前後的計畫全部暴露給監正會，大騎士長軍令傳下來的話，我哪有回頭路可走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更何況，我為了傳出行動開始的指令，已經將手裡的武器刺向了阻攔自己的下屬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我才知道，有些決定要堅持到底是多麼艱難......我更敬佩當年的你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你有什麼資格，將自己的一意孤行與我的所作所為相提並論？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我挑釁的對象確實沒有你那麼多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你並非挑釁......你的手段令人不齒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你不為自己的行為羞愧，何必以偽造軍情洩露的曲折方式，誘使我與萊塔尼亞的訪客為敵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必責問我的手段，我不過是......對你和對這個卡西米爾一樣失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "監正會不會容許征戰騎士內部的負面消息留存在任何一行文字之中，所以，如果我真的服從軍令......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得我是會在率隊伍回大騎士領的途中突然染上惡疾身亡，還是被軟禁在那座高樓的腳下永遠噤聲，就像現在的你一樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以你眼下的立場，不該來審視我的生活，切斯柏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你仍然一意孤行，試圖替千萬人決定他們的戰場所在，那你的確罪有應得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "替平民打仗是征戰騎士的天職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是戰爭最先拋棄手無寸鐵的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你應該有能力做出更明智的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使那個選擇不是回到征戰騎士的隊伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“我應該”？我應該就此逃離卡西米爾嗎？如果你真的堅信離開是唯一正確的選擇，你自己為什麼還一直留在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是說，我應該放棄全盤計畫，就算這是我最後的機會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你不是應該比我更清楚，卡西米爾需要真實的暴力，需要地覆天翻的戰爭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從未這麼想過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們認識這些年，總是仗著對彼此的瞭解，認為許多事情不言自明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事到如今我才想起來，也許這其中許多都是誤解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們真該好好聊聊，像過去那樣，在林間空曠的平地，燃燒的篝火前面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果你現在不是執意要阻攔我的去路，我就會像過去一樣挑一根樹枝做槍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你需要清醒一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貴族侍衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺，請壓低身體躲好！附近有數名弓箭手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......到底是什麼人？從昨晚到現在，什麼人會如此針對我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿洛希亞，我們走！這裡不會是真正的檢查點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "檢查員先生，您如果不願意被撞倒的話，就請讓——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，別別別，千萬別往前衝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看在我們的人幫忙把攔路的傢伙打昏了的分上，最好二位的源石技藝也都收一收，放輕鬆一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟有些小陷阱是受到劇烈能量衝擊就會爆炸的，要是車出了故障，你們回萊塔尼亞可能就不太方便了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是什麼時候出現——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貴族侍衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簡單來說，我們要把這位尊貴的先生從這裡帶走一會。能不能談個合作？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，我可是認真勸你的，陷阱引爆的話這裡可就誰都活不了啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說，你雖然本事不小，但也沒辦法獨自對付所有人，不如聽聽我的條件吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貴族侍衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們沒什麼可談，雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，你還真的想......引發爆炸波及附近所有人，然後給你已經被帶遠的主人一個逃離的機會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我從以前就不太喜歡應付你們這些瘋瘋癲癲的高塔術師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......冷靜點。我們都犯不著把命搭上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "檢查員不是我們的人，仍然潛伏在周圍的弓箭手們也不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貴族侍衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......說下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你聽懂啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹我們這行的呢，經常碰到多支隊伍爭奪同一個目標的事。不過有些人的任務是暫時保管，有些人則是想毀得乾乾淨淨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好想想吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外，從這裡出城往東南方向半小時路程，公路旁有個小村莊，最高的房子上掛著面快掉了的盾形徽章。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你願意在那裡等的話，咱們辦事可就方便多啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......令人懷念的法術輝光，真正的臨光啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在書中讀過西里爾的傳奇，在城市街頭的廣告裡見過耀騎士浮誇的名號，也從你口中聽說過你的兄長奪目如晝的光芒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我所熟知的臨光只是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像那場籌畫背叛的宴會......我以為自己推開門的時候會看到血流成河的景象，卻一腳踏進流淌光芒的雨水中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那已經是許多年前的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，被人以舊事讚譽，本身就是一種悲哀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些年你做什麼去了？......你的劍術並未生疏，光芒更加收斂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但凝聚在劍身的能量足夠架開重槍的全力一擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己既然有答案，為什麼還要問我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......因為我不相信你無能為力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不相信瑟莉娜被帶往大騎士領，在國民院接受審判的時候，你連證明她是被冤枉的都做不到。那甚至只是一句話的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不相信她就這麼悄無聲息地消失，而你從頭至尾沒有多看過她一眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "令我感到無能為力的事情有許多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為那些東西困不住你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在國民院面前證明無罪沒有任何意義。我們都救不了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去的你不會這麼說。國民院所看不到的公正，你會爭取將它寫入法典。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那場鬥爭牽連勢力太多，被判罪者就有十三人。一條法律不足以給他們帶去公正。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你在心裡想過了。你覺得他們遭受的冤屈不值得你拿自己的生活冒險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你開始怕死了嗎？還是覺得再沒有什麼值得你以生死相權衡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "征戰騎士的每一擊都很重。\n他的槍原本指向重甲與堅盾，指向壘石與鋼鐵的造物。\n但現在，他更多地是為自己無處可去的憤恨，刺向無形的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......動作差點失衡了，切斯柏。別犯這麼初級的錯誤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再有一次，你就不止是盔甲上出現裂痕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們確實是很久沒互相練手了，對吧？也許現在的我比你印象裡更凶一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢？......過去我們都勸你的時候，你從沒想過收起鋒刃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "又一次衝鋒。\n劈下的長槍砸向大地，岩石崩碎，飛濺的礫石在源石技藝的光輝上撞出火花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......躲得好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候，你不在乎那些顏面盡失的貴族和被你脅迫的商人怎麼想，不在乎來自都城高處的警告，也不在乎這一切是不是徒勞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以永遠不回大騎士領，可以為了正義燃盡自己的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......現在呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你做不到的話，那就看著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我替你做你該做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——憑你的信念，來斷定我該做的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "臨光的揮劍只像是甩落劍身上的雨水。\n燃燒的金色火光落在征戰騎士的盔甲上，灼出道道焦痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "憑你如此輕浮地將性命孤注一擲，明知毫無希望卻愚頑地不肯回頭的信念？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不希望你死在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的計畫不該實現，也不可能實現。你還在執著於什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cherunder_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳、咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，受人委託，來給您添點小麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "順帶一提，我們現在是在一輛藥品運輸車上，至於碎裂的擋風玻璃呢，是不巧被箭矢給砸的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一路把您轉移到這裡來可真是費了不少力氣啊。好在進了地下物流通道，我們應該可以休息一會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凌晨可是這裡最混亂的時候。倒貨、非正規交易、看似事故的車輛側翻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你們想要什麼？阿洛希亞......阿洛希亞呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，您的侍衛？如果她願意配合的話，這時候應該在城外等著了。我也需要她分走一些注意力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，她是個優秀的術師，單個追蹤她的弓箭手還不能拿她怎麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於我們......我們雖然算是來幫忙的，但還是多少要收一點錢，畢竟委託人那邊開的價可不高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有幾個兄弟受傷了，就算是補償他們流的這點血，我也希望跟您談一談您的贖金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——現在可以將您的手杖收起來了嗎？我以前就挺不喜歡跟萊塔尼亞逃難來的那些術師交手的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我明白了，我願意支付一定的贖金，並且不會試圖打聽你們的任何資訊，也不會作事後追究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望我們能保持這樣平和的談判。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，這就對啦，本來我們也只是替人辦事。等這輛運輸車把貨物送到指定地點，再稍微等一等......咱們就可以出城了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我聽得出貨箱裡是空的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可不敢有把您當貨物的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "運輸車是臨時租的，通行許可也是借來的，多少要裝裝樣子，才方便掩人耳目嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......而且，萬一您的侍衛有什麼三長兩短，憑這份境外企業的通行許可，我們也有充分理由把您送到卡西米爾外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們為什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，沒什麼。我不會再追問了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可就太好啦。為了打發這段等待的時間，要不咱們就來談一下錢的事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你問我......在執著什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我選擇回歸征戰騎士的隊伍，重新踏上一名貴族家臣的道路，是為了繼續尋找同行者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別誤會我，瑪恩納，我並非追求戰爭。戰爭終將到來，騎士本就應該承擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "許多人不曾見過萊塔尼亞高塔的陰影，不曾聽見北風中夾雜的號哭，以至於為競技場上的鮮血鼓掌喝彩，但我對他們並無憤恨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士精神雖然在征戰騎士之中閃耀餘輝，但它的光彩並不是武器的鋒芒，我想請人們見識的也並非暴力的權柄，或者荒野的骨骸與煙塵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望被看到的是，人們不僅可以選擇掠奪，踐踏，戕害他人性命......也可以選擇為他人犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士的血是為此而流的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——騎士的榮光不必寄託於他人見證。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放棄立足之地，將命運交予自己無法掌控的戰爭......你又能以什麼自稱堅守騎士精神？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些為你鋪路的死傷者，你還能夠像過去一樣為他們流淚，感到悲戚嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一滴雨水落在槍尖。\n像是提前升起的細雨綿綿的清晨，光在林間的夜霧中彌漫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊，你終於肯完完全全地施展你的源石技藝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，我全副武裝，你卻連基礎的護具都沒有，這樣能算是公正的決鬥嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼甲胄能擋住征戰騎士的全力一擊？更何況是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，那真是最好不過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cherunder_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眼神很好嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認識的某些貴族，跟我們打了兩個月的交道才反應過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也有些人，雖然第一眼就認出來了，但一直隻字不提，就像什麼都不知道似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......薩卡茲雇傭兵。卡西米爾的商業機器，把你們這樣的人也收編其中了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說可真是抬舉我們啦。雖說我不敢介意您想把我們當成什麼，但這裡窩藏的倒真不止薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡西米爾也確實對我們一視同仁，不過呢，是在它決定要拋棄哪些人的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，被嚇到了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲唯一的特別之處，大概也就是會比大多數卡西米爾人活得久那麼一點點吧？而且，我還算是挺年輕的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_625_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不過，老朋友終究還是見一個少一個了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "淅淅瀝瀝的雨。銀色的碎片。\n殘破的盔甲裡盛不下的鮮血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......到此為止吧。你已經輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想讓我向誰認輸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "征戰騎士再度握緊長槍，刺向前方。\n但他的步伐並沒有邁出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你想讓我，向誰認輸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一步踉蹌之後，騎士跪倒在地。金色的光雨淌過他的臉頰。\n他仰著頭，在撲面而來的雨水中睜大眼睛，直視著一言不發的臨光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——向那些坐在監正會的高樓裡，仍舊醉心於權謀與虛名的貴族嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是向那些用滑稽的謊言粉飾太平，將扭曲的欲望裝扮成鏡頭前風趣的商人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要我回頭認錯，承認自己終究無法對抗血脈織構的威權嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是要我逃離卡西米爾，放棄這些年的鬥爭，向我們仇視過的一切低頭和解？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我只是，看不到其他值得去走的道路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這唯一的可能你也不予承認，是嗎？那就用你的劍向我證明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果認為我做錯了的人是你，那我可以接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並非敗給權力，敗給金錢，也並非敗給求生的意志，敗給蹉跎的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪恩納收起了劍。\n黎明前寒涼的夜色中，只有光雨仍然淅淅瀝瀝地滴落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過......你沒有必要死在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只要對方願意回頭，他想。自己就會停手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪恩納，你是如何能甘心的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使你的憤怒比我更加熾烈，即使我見過的一切你也不會陌生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不會看不到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商業聯合會早已開始對征戰騎士指手畫腳，越來越多的騎士試圖變賣榮耀，甚至投向商人們糾集武裝力量的野心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊塔尼亞......巫王高塔倒下後，他們已經休養許久。我親眼見到他們為戰爭所做的籌備，唯有恐怖，絕無浪漫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而每一個時代，都有那麼多人在荒野上流浪......天災、戰爭和城市的進化同樣地驅逐他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你明明知道這一切......為什麼不肯拔劍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還有，守在所有向理想傾注的熱忱的最後，那一聲高高在上的嗤笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——就像在那漫長徒勞的旅途之後......你不得不回到大騎士領的時刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪恩納，我不相信你能放得下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那兩個在光芒最盛的一刻被突然抹去的名字，如同投入深潭的火種，驟然熄滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十五年來，監正會三緘其口，你的追問從來沒有得到回應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臨光家的人，耀眼如他們那樣的人，卻被卡西米爾拒絕......這個沉沒在黑夜中的國家甚至不肯容下他們的一線輝光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你失望至極......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你甚至......不曾得知他們在異國他鄉等待了多少年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "數年前，潛入萊塔尼亞的時候......我曾經與他們偶遇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滴答。\n收到的最後一封家書上，有一滴暈開的墨漬。\n近二十年的疑問，他不曾有機會予以一封去信。\n二十年的沉默後，他知道這是自己能向征戰騎士問出的唯一一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_4064_mlynar_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你對其他人，提起過這件事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "切斯柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "切斯柏緩緩地搖了搖頭。\n漫長的沉默中，瑪恩納等待著下一句控訴，或是他等待得更久的一句悔過。\n但回應他的，只有如同歎息的一聲沉重的呼吸，隨後是金屬之間輕輕的碰撞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "征戰騎士的身體倚向深深紮入地面的長槍。\n像無數具他們曾在荒原上見過的，空空蕩蕩的甲胄。\n片刻之後，瑪恩納在雨中跪下，向他曾經的同路人，行以騎士的哀悼禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
